<title>GERMANY: Audi says 1996 Jan-Aug sales up 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Audi says 1996 Jan-Aug sales up 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German luxury carmaker Audi AG said on Friday that its worldwide sales for the period from January to August were up 6.5 percent to 324,446 vehicles.</p>
<p>The Ingolstadt-based carmaker, a unit of Volkswagen AG, also said its market share in Germany during the eight-month period fell to 5.8 percent from 6.4 percent in the year-ago period, which included the launch of its popular A4 saloon.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
